# 🎨 design-guidelines.md

## ✨ Visual Style
- **Inspiration:** Airbnb, QuintoAndar
- **Aesthetic:** Minimalist, modern, and accessible
- **Colors:** Neutral palette with soft accent highlights (e.g., blue, purple, or green)
- **Typography:** Modern sans-serif (e.g., Inter, Poppins, or Urbanist)
- **Whitespace:** Generous spacing to emphasize content
- **UI Elements:** Rounded corners, soft shadows, subtle transitions

## 📱 Layout and Components
- **Responsiveness:** Mobile-first, adapting well to tablets and desktops
- **Navigation:** Collapsible sidebar on desktop, top menu or drawer on mobile
- **Cards:** Used for reports, insights, personas, and tool results
- **Buttons:** Well-spaced with clear visual states (hover, active, disabled)

## 🌐 Accessibility
- Proper text contrast (validated by automated tools)
- Full keyboard navigation support
- Resizable and readable text
- Alt text for all images and screenshots
- Screen reader compatibility for all key UI areas

## 🗣️ Brand Voice
- **Language:** Clear, welcoming, and concise
- **Tone:** Professional yet friendly (no unnecessary jargon)
- **Overall Experience:** Intuitive, smooth, focused on fast results

## 🧩 Additional Visual Details
- Immediate visual feedback when using tools (e.g., loaders, checkmarks, toasts)
- Highlighted insights in AI results (e.g., bolded key phrases)
- Dark mode planned for V1 (neutral base + adapted accent colors)

